  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2016/07/IMG_7649.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14.6667px; line-height: 21.3333px;\">76 fotos de las actuaciones finales en la 2&ordf; &#39;Summer Fun Week&#39; de Kids&amp;Us Onda, &#39;School of English&#39; situada en la pla&ccedil;a de les Corts Valencianes, 9, en un entorno de plazas y jardines donde este verano ni&ntilde;os y ni&ntilde;as pueden disfrutar, siempre en ingl&eacute;s,&nbsp;durante&nbsp;el mes de julio con tem&aacute;ticas diferentes.</span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/final2ondfunweekkidsampusonda/img_7631.jpg\" alt=\"img_7631\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/final2ondfunweekkidsampusonda/img_7633.jpg\" alt=\"img_7633\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/final2ondfunweekkidsampusonda/img_7635.jpg\" alt=\"img_7635\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/final2ondfunweekkidsampusonda/img_7636.jpg\" alt=\"img_7636\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/final2ondfunweekkidsampusonda/img_7637.jpg\" alt=\"img_7637\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/final2ondfunweekkidsampusonda/img_7638.jpg\" alt=\"img_7638\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/final2ondfunweekkidsampusonda/img_7640.jpg\" alt=\"img_7640\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/final2ondfunweekkidsampusonda/img_7641.jp